AI “should always remain
under human control. ”

18
00:01:07,731 --> 00:01:11,794
Korea–Mexico summit: investment treaty
revised, FTA talks to speed up.

19
00:01:11,834 --> 00:01:16,043
President Lee Jae-myung concluded a
revision of the bilateral investment

20
00:01:16,083 --> 00:01:20,411
treaty after seven years of talks and
called a trade agreement “essential.

21
00:01:20,451 --> 00:01:23,498
” Export-import banks set
up $100M in export credit,

